<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="fissure-stone-fragments">Fissure Stone Fragments</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>s are a new currency introduced with Rage of the Firelands. There are a wide range of items available through this currency, meaning which items to prioritize are based on whatever the largest upgrade is for you specifically. Generally, you will want to aim for any item that has an item level of 379, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60237/crown-of-the-twilight-queen">
<img alt="Crown of the Twilight Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Twilight Queen</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60232/shroud-of-endless-grief">
<img alt="Shroud of Endless Grief" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shroud of Endless Grief</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65053/bell-of-enraging-resonance">
<img alt="Bell of Enraging Resonance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bell_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bell of Enraging Resonance</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65138/bracers-of-the-bronze-flight">
<img alt="Bracers of the Bronze Flight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Bronze Flight</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60238/bracers-of-the-dark-mother">
<img alt="Bracers of the Dark Mother" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Dark Mother</span></a> are also a great options if you do not have the gold or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to spend on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71265/emberflame-bracers">
<img alt="Emberflame Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emberflame Bracers</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>You can then look to get any of the random enchantment items, a weapon, off-hand or wand as necessary. A lot of these item slots have a better alternative from either <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> or <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/molten-front-zone-overview">The Molten Front</a> quests or vendors.<br/>
