<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71284/balespiders-robes">
<img alt="Balespider's Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balespider's Robes</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 2200 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60251/shadowflame-robes">
<img alt="Shadowflame Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Robes</span></a> is part of our tier 11 set and can now be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59454/shadowblaze-robes">
<img alt="Shadowblaze Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowblaze Robes</span></a> has the benefit of providing hit rating and can be bought with 60 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, due to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60251/shadowflame-robes">
<img alt="Shadowflame Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Robes</span></a> being on par and our Tier 12 even being better we should likely spend our hard-earned <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> on other items first. Just like our back, we got a Bind when Equipped World Drop option. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67133/dizzes-whirling-robe">
<img alt="Dizze's Whirling Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dizze's Whirling Robe</span></a> will be only available for those with deep pockets. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69598/robes-of-dissention">
<img alt="Robes of Dissention" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_kilt_cloth_04v2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Dissention</span></a> should be an easier to get alternative, by completing <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=11196/warlord-of-the-amani">
<img alt="Warlord of the Amani" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warlord of the Amani</span></a>. Those unlucky in heroics and not revered yet with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a> can always opt to spend their <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58153/robes-of-embalmed-darkness">
<img alt="Robes of Embalmed Darkness" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Embalmed Darkness</span></a> as a temporary solution.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a></div>
