<img alt="Corsair's Overshirt" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corsair's Overshirt</span></a> <span class="q2">[H]</span></td>
