<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71265/emberflame-bracers">
<img alt="Emberflame Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emberflame Bracers</span></a> is a bind on equipped that can be bought for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, expect these to be very expensive. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65138/bracers-of-the-bronze-flight">
<img alt="Bracers of the Bronze Flight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Bronze Flight</span></a> is another great option that can be bought for 50 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>, so here you will have to make a choice to either spend gold/<wbr/>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> if you want some of the best options. Another option that can potentially be bought is the normal <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60211/bracers-of-the-dark-pool">
<img alt="Bracers of the Dark Pool" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Dark Pool</span></a> which is a trash drop from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5334/the-bastion-of-twilight">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Bastion of Twilight</span></a>.  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69585/wristwraps-of-madness">
<img alt="Wristwraps of Madness" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wristwraps of Madness</span></a> should be easier to get as it drops from <a data-entity="object" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/object=186648/hazleks-trunk">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Hazlek's Trunk</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a>. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56389/sand-silk-wristband">
<img alt="Sand Silk Wristband" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sand Silk Wristband</span></a> from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=49045/augh">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Augh</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=43614/lockmaw">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lockmaw</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5396/lost-city-of-the-tolvir">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lost City of the Tol'vir</span></a> is another good option, even the normal version of the item. It has a solid amount of hit rating on it. Alternatively <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63484/armbands-of-exiled-architects">
<img alt="Armbands of Exiled Architects" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of Exiled Architects</span></a> is quite close but requires you to reforge some of the mastery if you want hit rating. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=66917/true-archaeologists-bracers">
<img alt="True Archaeologist's Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">True Archaeologist's Bracers</span></a> can also be an RNG-free option to get good bracers, namely by completing <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=28753/doing-it-the-hard-way">
<img alt="Doing it the Hard Way" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Doing it the Hard Way</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4945/halls-of-origination">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halls of Origination</span></a>. Unlike most other slots there is not a good alternative that can be bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a></div>
