<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=46962/baron-ashbury">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baron Ashbury</span></a>
<br/>
<span class="small-text">
<a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=209/shadowfang-keep">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowfang Keep</span></a></span> <span class="q2">[H]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71281/balespiders-handwraps">
<img alt="Balespider's Handwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balespider's Handwraps</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 1650 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69945/don-tayos-inferno-mittens">
<img alt="Don Tayo's Inferno Mittens" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Don Tayo's Inferno Mittens</span></a> is a new epic tailoring craft that requires new raid materials, making these an equally great option before raiding but also the most expensive option. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67132/grips-of-the-failed-immortal">
<img alt="Grips of the Failed Immortal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grips of the Failed Immortal</span></a> is one of the various world drop Bind when Equipped items, having one of the highest item levels and two of our main secondary stats namely critical strike and haste rating makes it our best option. However, it will be incredibly expensive and most likely not worth the gold as it will be eventually replaced. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60248/shadowflame-handwraps">
<img alt="Shadowflame Handwraps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Handwraps</span></a> is a straightforward choice, it has great stats and is part of our <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=941/shadowflame-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Regalia</span></a>. It does require us to spend our <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> so it will take us a good while to get. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62364/flamebloom-gloves">
<img alt="Flamebloom Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flamebloom Gloves</span></a> is also a great option but requires us to be exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1135/the-earthen-ring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Earthen Ring</span></a> and likely to reforge some stat into hit rating. Alternatively, we can make use of <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56286/mnemiopsis-gloves">
<img alt="Mnemiopsis Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mnemiopsis Gloves</span></a> if we require the additional hit rating.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Gloves Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82175/synapse-springs">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Synapse Springs</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a></div>
