<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71283/balespiders-leggings">
<img alt="Balespider's Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidwarlock_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Balespider's Leggings</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 2200 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. Alternatively, in this slot we can buy a part of our <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=941/shadowflame-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Regalia</span></a> with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. Ignoring set pieces, we can craft/<wbr/>buy either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54506/flame-ascended-pantaloons">
<img alt="Flame-Ascended Pantaloons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flame-Ascended Pantaloons</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54505/breeches-of-mended-nightmares">
<img alt="Breeches of Mended Nightmares" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of Mended Nightmares</span></a>, both lack hit rating something to be mindful of if you are under the hit cap. A cheaper option might be <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65383/soul-breath-leggings">
<img alt="Soul Breath Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul Breath Leggings</span></a> which we can get for only 21 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> from the Inferno Protocol Heroics.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Pants Spellthread</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54448/powerful-enchanted-spellthread">
<img alt="Powerful Enchanted Spellthread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_eternium.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Powerful Enchanted Spellthread</span></a></div>
