<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71210/crystalline-brimstone-ring">
<img alt="Crystalline Brimstone Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_01b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystalline Brimstone Ring</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70124/spirit-fragment-band">
<img alt="Spirit Fragment Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirit Fragment Band</span></a> can be bought from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53882/varlan-highbough">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Varlan Highbough</span></a> after completing <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=29283/calling-the-ancients">
<img alt="Calling the Ancients" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Calling the Ancients</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65373/planetary-band">
<img alt="Planetary Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Band</span></a> is one of our best options, it can be gotten from the new Inferno Protocol Heroics for 12 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67129/signet-of-high-arcanist-savor">
<img alt="Signet of High Arcanist Savor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of High Arcanist Savor</span></a> is a great ring that has a lot of stats including hit rating, however seeing as it is a World Drop it will be hard or expensive to get. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58188/band-of-secret-names">
<img alt="Band of Secret Names" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_diamondring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Secret Names</span></a> is another one of our best rings but costs 1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a> is also a solid ring that requires you to get lucky with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a>. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65169/lavishly-jeweled-ring">
<img alt="Lavishly Jeweled Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_76.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lavishly Jeweled Ring</span></a> alternatively provides a solid amount of hit rating and can be found in the heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1581/the-deadmines">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Deadmines</span></a>. Similarly <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62415/band-of-lamentation">
<img alt="Band of Lamentation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_kingsring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Lamentation</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62427/band-of-singing-grass">
<img alt="Band of Singing Grass" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Singing Grass</span></a> also has a solid amount of hit rating and only required us to get revered with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>. Plenty of other great rings can be found inside dungeons such as <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56276/anthias-ring">
<img alt="Anthia's Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonering2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anthia's Ring</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56432/band-of-rays">
<img alt="Band of Rays" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Rays</span></a> for example.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=333/enchanting">
<img alt="Enchanting" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchanting</span></a>).</div>
