<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62047/darkmoon-card-volcano">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Volcano" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_volcanocard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Volcano</span></a> is technically our best in slot trinket this phase. This is due to the high amount of mastery it provides but also the great proc effect which deals damage to the target but more importantly increases our intellect by 1600 for 12 seconds. The card however will be expansive as it requires darkmoon cards to complete  <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=27664/darkmoon-volcanic-deck">
<img alt="Darkmoon Volcanic Deck" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Volcanic Deck</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71210/crystalline-brimstone-ring">
<img alt="Crystalline Brimstone Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_01b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystalline Brimstone Ring</span></a> is a great option to pair with it, it can be bought with 50 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70142/moonwell-chalice">
<img alt="Moonwell Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Moonwell Chalice</span></a> is a great niche trinket that can be used before combat to get a bump in mastery after which it can be swapped for another trinket right before the fight. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62465/stump-of-time">
<img alt="Stump of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stump of Time</span></a> provides us with a massive amount of hit rating, and a great proc providing 1926 spell power for 15 sec. It should prove simple to get as it only requires reaching exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1178/hellscreams-reach">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Hellscream's Reach</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1177/baradins-wardens">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin's Wardens</span></a>. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56320/witching-hourglass">
<img alt="Witching Hourglass" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_khoriumpowercore.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Witching Hourglass</span></a> is a good dungeon alternative that drops from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a> if you don't need additional hit rating. If you do need more hit rating you could opt for something like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56407/anhuurs-hymnal">
<img alt="Anhuur's Hymnal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anhuur's Hymnal</span></a>, which drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=39425/temple-guardian-anhuur">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Temple Guardian Anhuur</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4945/halls-of-origination">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halls of Origination</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
