<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="1-handed-weapons">1-Handed Weapons</h3>Those with deep pockets might be able to get their hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70156/masterwork-elementium-spellblade">
<img alt="Masterwork Elementium Spellblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_b_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Masterwork Elementium Spellblade</span></a>. This is the highest item-level weapon you can get before entering raids. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63536/blade-of-the-witching-hour">
<img alt="Blade of the Witching Hour" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_bwdraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blade of the Witching Hour</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59341/incineratus">
<img alt="Incineratus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_bwdraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Incineratus</span></a> are both great options from the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3148/fissure-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Fissure Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_talisman_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fissure Stone Fragment</span></span></a> from Infernfo Protocol Heroics. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59463/maldos-sword-cane">
<img alt="Maldo's Sword Cane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_bwdraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maldo's Sword Cane</span></a> is in a similar position but can be bought of the Auction House as well.   <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69844/vitreous-beak-of-julak-doom">
<img alt="Vitreous Beak of Julak-Doom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vitreous Beak of Julak-Doom</span></a> is also a good weapon depending on whether it is in its epic state or rare <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67246/beak-of-julak-doom">
<img alt="Beak of Julak-Doom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Beak of Julak-Doom</span></a>. Either way both drop of the rare <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=50089/julak-doom">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Julak-Doom</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4922/twilight-highlands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Highlands</span></a> and are bound on equip. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55064/elementium-spellblade">
<img alt="Elementium Spellblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_grimbatolraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Spellblade</span></a> is a great alternative that also provides hit rating and can be crafted by a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a>. Alternatively, the "free" option is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69591/voodoo-hexblade">
<img alt="Voodoo Hexblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Voodoo Hexblade</span></a> which is contained in <a data-entity="object" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/object=186667/norkanis-package">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Norkani's Package</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=3805/zulaman">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Aman</span></a> but relies on RNG to see the drop.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52774/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a></div>
