<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wand">Wand</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71151/trail-of-embers">
<img alt="Trail of Embers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_firelandsraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trail of Embers</span></a> is our best option, it can be bought with 700 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, however with a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> it will likely take a while to get this. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59460/theresas-booklight">
<img alt="Theresa's Booklight" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Theresa's Booklight</span></a> is a bind-on equipped from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5094/blackwing-descent">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackwing Descent</span></a>, and as such can be bought of the auction house for a fair penny. Alternatively <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69607/touch-of-discord">
<img alt="Touch of Discord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_stratholme_a_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Touch of Discord</span></a> and  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69631/zulian-voodoo-stick">
<img alt="Zulian Voodoo Stick" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_23.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zulian Voodoo Stick</span></a> both drop in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1977/zulgurub">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Zul'Gurub</span></a> and are great options as well. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56296/corlas-baton">
<img alt="Corla's Baton" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_cataclysm_c_01-.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Corla's Baton</span></a> is our overall a good wand. It drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=39679/corla-herald-of-twilight">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Corla, Herald of Twilight</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a>. Alternatively <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65172/cookies-stirring-rod">
<img alt="Cookie's Stirring Rod" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cookie's Stirring Rod</span></a> works well too but you might want to reforge the critical strike rating. Alternatively <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=66920/cyus-ornate-wand">
<img alt="Cyu's Ornate Wand" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_cataclysm_c_01-.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cyu's Ornate Wand</span></a> can be bought from the auction house for a fair penny.<div class="pad"></div>
